{"id":"sesio_n","lemma":"sesión","pos":"noun","rank":1698,"glosses":["session (meeting)","showing (in a cinema, theatre etc.)","session (period of time)"],"ipa":"/seˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"sesiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-sesi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"El parlamento está ahora en sesión.","en":"Parliament is now in session.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803985"},{"text":"¿A qué hora concluyó la sesión?","en":"What time did the meeting end?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/355143"},{"text":"No has iniciado sesión.","en":"You are not logged in."},{"text":"Prosigamos con la sesión.","en":"Let's get on with the meeting."},{"text":"Mucha gente concurrió a la sesión.","en":"Many people attended the meeting."}]}